---

---

<section
  id="about"
  class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-myColor-800 py-24"
>
  <div class="text-center space-y-8">
    <div class="md:max-w-2xl m-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="about-heading leading-none mb-2">
        Hi
      </h2>
      <span class="heading-accent-bar block h-0.5 mt-3 mx-auto w-12 rounded-full mb-10"></span>

      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-myColor-100 mt-6 font-sans leading-relaxed">
        I'm Adam, a Toronto-based (but remote-friendly) Engineering leader. I'm
        a Senior Engineer, an Engineering Manager, project planner, delivery
        lead... tl;dr: I can do what needs to be done.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-myColor-100 mt-4 font-sans leading-relaxed">
        I'm full-stack, but frontend-focused. Do you need someone to manage a
        design system? Lead a team to deliver a complex project? Have a hard
        conversation about deadlines & capacity planning? I can help with that.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-myColor-100 mt-4 font-sans leading-relaxed">
        I love enabling engineers to do their best, by introducing and iterating
        on processes, coaching and facilitating conversations, and especially
        using AI to keep everyone moving.
      </p>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl text-myColor-100 mt-16 font-mono font-bold">
          Skills & Frameworks
        </h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mt-6">
          {[
            "JavaScript",
            "React",
            "Node.js",
            "TypeScript",
            "Git",
            "Design Systems",
            "React Testing Library",
            "Python 🐍",
            "Project Planning",
            "Linear",
            "AI Engineering",
          ].map((skill) => (
            <li>
              <span class="skill-badge">{skill}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-family-display);
    font-size: clamp(64px, 10vw, 120px);
    color: #f0ede8;
  }

  .heading-accent-bar {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #f87060, #fbbdac);
  }

  .skill-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: rgba(240, 237, 232, 0.9);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .skill-badge:hover {
    border-color: #f87060;
    color: #fbbdac;
    background: rgba(248, 112, 96, 0.1);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(248, 112, 96, 0.2);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .skill-badge {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
